text":"번째","x":1560,"y":710,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"요","x":1630,"y":712,"width":31,"height":25}]},{"text":"소를 피봇으로 하자. 피벗보다 작은 요소들은 모두 피벗의 왼쪽으로 옮겨지고 피벗보다 큰 요소","words":[{"text":"소를","x":390,"y":764,"width":62,"height":31},{"text":"피봇으로","x":464,"y":764,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"하자.","x":590,"y":763,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"피벗보다","x":669,"y":763,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"작은","x":793,"y":764,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"요소들은","x":862,"y":764,"width":115,"height":31},{"text":"모두","x":988,"y":766,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"피벗의","x":1058,"y":764,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"왼쪽으로","x":1158,"y":765,"width":118,"height":32},{"text":"옮겨지고","x":1288,"y":765,"width":123,"height":33},{"text":"피벗보다","x":1424,"y":765,"width":123,"height":33},{"text":"큰","x":1557,"y":767,"width":32,"height":30},{"text":"요소","x":1600,"y":767,"width":60,"height":25}]},{"text":"들 은 모두 피벗의 오른쪽으로 옮겨진다. 결과적으로 피벗을 중심으로 왼쪽은 피벗보다 작은 요","words":[{"text":"들","x":395,"y":819,"width":21,"height":30},{"text":"은","x":425,"y":819,"width":22,"height":31},{"text":"모두","x":464,"y":821,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"피벗의","x":536,"y":819,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"오른쪽으로","x":633,"y":820,"width":142,"height":31},{"text":"옮겨진다.","x":786,"y":818,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"결과적으로","x":925,"y":818,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"피벗을","x":1083,"y":820,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"중심으로","x":1182,"y":820,"width":120,"height":32},{"text":"왼쪽은","x":1316,"y":820,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"피벗보다","x":1422,"y":820,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"작은","x":1557,"y":820,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"요","x":1630,"y":823,"width":30,"height":25}]},{"text":"소들로 구성되괴 오른쪽은 피벗보다 큰 요소들로 구성된다. 이 상태에서 피벗을 제외한 왼쪽 리","words":[{"text":"소들로","x":391,"y":875,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"구성되괴","x":490,"y":874,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"오른쪽은","x":628,"y":874,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"피벗보다","x":753,"y":873,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"큰","x":876,"y":876